    "Safe default shortcuts cover the primary timer, basic scoring, secondary timer control, home/guest secondary-timer assignment, and player-page navigation. Reset-style actions stay unassigned until you choose them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安全的默认快捷键涵盖主计时器、基础得分、副计时器控制、主/客队副计时器分配和球员页面导航。重置类操作在你主动分配前保持未分配。"
