    "Use Keyboard Shortcuts to assign hardware keyboard commands to stable live control board actions. Shortcuts work on Mac, iPad, and iPhone when the live board is active and settings, text fields, alerts, or sheets are not open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用键盘快捷键为稳定的实时控制板操作分配硬件键盘命令。快捷键适用于 Mac、iPad 和 iPhone，并且仅在实时控制板处于活动状态且设置、文本框、提醒或表单未打开时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
