    "Choose Sport" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择运动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the base left/right orientation for each screen. Swap Sides still flips the live layout during the game. To change Remote Display direction, go to Integration > Remote Display." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择每个屏幕的基础左右方向。比赛中“交换双方”仍会翻转实时布局。若要更改远程显示方向，请前往“集成”>“远程显示”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the debate format, round title, side labels, and whether score is tracked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择辩论赛制、回合标题、双方标签以及是否跟踪比分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the look for both the operator controls and public scoreboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择操作端和公开记分牌的外观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the public display mode and preview the external scoreboard without requiring an attached display. This preview may not match the connected external display exactly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择公开显示模式，并在不连接显示器的情况下预览外部记分牌。此预览可能与已连接的外部显示器不完全一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the scoreboard mode before editing teams, clocks, and tracking rules." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先选择记分牌模式，再编辑队伍、计时和跟踪规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the sport whose Companion assignments you want to edit. Assignments are stored per sport, so basketball, soccer, debate, and custom games can each trigger different Companion buttons." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择要编辑 Companion 分配的运动项目。分配按运动项目保存，因此篮球、足球、辩论和自定义比赛都可以触发不同的 Companion 按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the sport, teams, clock defaults, and tracking options before opening the live control board." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the setup step for the scoreboard.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先选择运动、队伍、计时默认值和跟踪选项，再打开实时控制面板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the sport, teams, clock defaults, display options, files, and integrations before opening the live board." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先选择运动、队伍、计时默认值、显示选项、文件和集成，再打开实时控制面板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose which integration settings to edit. This selector is only navigation: Web API, Remote Display, and Bitfocus Companion each keep their own enabled state, connection details, and assignments." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择要编辑的集成设置。此选择器仅用于导航：Web API、远程显示和 Bitfocus Companion 各自保留启用状态、连接详情和分配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose which sport's automation assignments to edit. The live board keeps using the currently configured game sport." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
