    "Dual Clock Segment" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "双计时环节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dual Clock Segments" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "双计时环节"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dual Clock segments give each side its own countdown for cross-examination, flex prep, or side-controlled speaking time. Set the starting side and decide whether operators can switch the active side during the segment before saving the custom debate format." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "双计时环节会为双方分别提供倒计时，适用于交叉询问、弹性准备或由双方控制的发言时间。保存自定义辩论赛制前，请设置起始方，并决定操作员是否可以在该环节中切换当前方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dual side" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "双侧计时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duplicate Current Setup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "复制当前设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duration" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each block becomes one step in the live debate timer. Add speeches, crossfires, prep breaks, or side-clock segments in the order they should run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个模块都会成为实时辩论计时器中的一步。按运行顺序添加演讲、交叉质询、准备休息或分方计时环节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each saved or connected Remote Display can use its own direction because screens may be mounted on opposite sides of the court, field, room, or player area. Set the direction here for that physical display, then use Swap Sides during the game only when the teams or sides need to flip live across every output." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个已保存或已连接的远程显示都可以使用自己的方向，因为屏幕可能安装在球场、场地、房间或选手区域的相对两侧。请在此为该物理显示设备设置方向；比赛中只有在队伍或双方需要在所有输出上实时翻转时才使用“交换双方”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
