    "Remote Display uses nearby device pairing to send the public scoreboard to Apple TV, iPad, or Mac without IP addresses or the Web API. The operator device stays in control and paired displays receive live scoreboard, theme, and sound settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "远程显示使用附近设备配对，将公开记分牌发送到 Apple TV、iPad 或 Mac，无需 IP 地址或 Web API。操作设备保持控制权，已配对的显示设备会接收实时记分牌、主题和声音设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remote Display, Web API, and Companion are separate integrations. Selecting one only changes which settings are shown." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the different integrations available for the scoreboard.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
