    "Test Companion command" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试 Companion 命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The center card mirrors the public scoreboard with scores, active timers, periods, and sport-specific status." : {
      "comment" : "A tip that explains what the live game state card represents.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中央卡片会镜像公开记分牌，显示比分、当前计时、阶段和运动项目专属状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Companion command timed out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Companion 命令超时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The control board is easier to use in landscape mode. Rotate iPhone for wider controls and fewer stacked panels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "控制面板在横屏模式下更易使用。旋转 iPhone 可获得更宽的控件空间，并减少堆叠面板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current sport uses score, clock, and substitution controls only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前项目只使用比分、计时和换人控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hidden app icon is now active on this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备已启用隐藏 App 图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The logo pattern travels on a slight slope." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标志图案会沿轻微斜坡移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The period, set, half, or segment changes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "节、局、半场或环节改变"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The preview renders from the current game state, theme, display direction, background, logos, and player settings. Treat it as an operator check of the selected public mode, not as a pixel-perfect guarantee for every connected screen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "预览会根据当前比赛状态、主题、显示方向、背景、标志和球员设置渲染。请把它视为操作员对所选公开模式的检查，而不是对每个已连接屏幕像素级一致性的保证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected image could not be encoded for display." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法将所选图像编码用于显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected image could not be prepared for display." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法准备所选图像用于显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected image could not be read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取所选图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Web API demo pages use bundled first-party HTML, CSS, and JavaScript only. No third-party web libraries are included for these integrations." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Web API 演示页面仅使用随附的第一方 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript。这些集成不包含任何第三方网页库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Themes update the setup screen, live control board, preview, and external scoreboard together." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主题会同时更新设置屏幕、实时控制面板、预览和外部记分牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These affect the public scoreboard display only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置只影响公开记分牌显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These labels and tracking options are saved with the custom debate format." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些标签和跟踪选项会随自定义辩论格式保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-Party Licenses" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第三方许可证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thirty-second ballpark organ melody" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "约 30 秒的球场风琴旋律"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This API publishes scoreboard state to the trusted local network only. Connected devices can read live game data, but the service rejects score, clock, roster, file, and settings changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 API 只向可信的本地网络发布记分牌状态。已连接设备可以读取实时比赛数据，但服务会拒绝比分、计时、名单、文件和设置更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app does not collect any data and does not phone any third-party server." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the app's privacy policy.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本应用不会收集任何数据，也不会连接任何第三方服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This debate format includes Dual Clock segments. Those blocks run separate side clocks, starting from the configured side and optionally allowing operators to switch active sides during the segment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此辩论赛制包含“双计时”环节。这些模块会运行独立的双方计时，从配置的起始方开始，并可选择允许操作员在环节中切换当前方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This debate format includes No Timer segments. Those blocks appear in the live round sequence as checkpoints or transitions, but they do not run a speech clock." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此辩论赛制包含“无计时”环节。这些模块会作为检查点或过渡出现在实时轮次流程中，但不会运行发言计时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This debate segment has no timer. Use it as a live checklist step for instructions, transitions, prep reminders, or judge/admin pauses, then move to the previous or next segment when the round flow is ready to continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此辩论环节没有计时。可将它作为实时清单步骤，用于说明、过渡、准备提醒或评委/管理暂停；当轮次流程准备继续时，再移动到上一环节或下一环节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This debate segment uses two side clocks. Start the active side, switch turns when control changes, and use the active-side jog buttons carefully because time adjustments apply to the currently selected side clock." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
