          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use About to disable contextual tips, reset TipKit history, or show Getting Started again." : {
      "comment" : "A tip that shows when the user taps the About button.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可在“关于”中关闭上下文提示、重置 TipKit 历史，或再次显示入门页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Bitfocus Companion settings to send PRESS commands to a Companion instance on the local network. Show Companion controls whether operators see the live-board toggle, while Enable Companion controls whether event commands are sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 Bitfocus Companion 设置向本地网络中的 Companion 实例发送 PRESS 命令。“显示 Companion”控制操作员是否看到实时面板切换按钮，而“启用 Companion”控制是否发送事件命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Clock to decide whether the custom sport has one shared timer, no main timer, count-up or count-down behavior, or separate side clocks. The opening values here become the live board reset targets." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“计时”决定自定义运动是否使用共享计时、无主计时、正计时或倒计时，或独立的双方计时。这里的初始值会成为实时控制面板的重置目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Companion when scoreboard events should trigger production automation, such as switching scenes, firing graphics, or controlling external gear. Scoreboard sends button press commands to Companion; Companion handles the downstream actions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当记分牌事件需要触发制作自动化时使用 Companion，例如切换场景、触发图形或控制外部设备。Scoreboard 会向 Companion 发送按钮按下命令；Companion 负责后续动作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Display Control to switch what viewers see while keeping the operator controls private. Mode changes apply to the public scoreboard window, external displays, and paired Remote Display devices, while the preview below gives a quick confidence check before or during a game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“显示控制”切换观众看到的内容，同时保持操作控制私密。模式更改会应用到公开记分牌窗口、外部显示器和已配对的远程显示设备，下方预览可在赛前或比赛中快速确认效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Display to shape the public scoreboard presentation without changing the live game state. These options control lineup overflow, team and event logos, foul highlighting, and clock warning colors shown on external, public, and remote displays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“显示”调整公开记分牌呈现方式，而不会改变实时比赛状态。这些选项控制外部、公开和远程显示上的阵容超出行为、队伍和赛事标志、犯规高亮以及计时警示颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Displays to see which remote screens are available, saved, connected, or waiting for a pairing code. Pair new screens from their four-digit code and reuse saved displays for faster setup at the next event." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“显示设备”查看哪些远程屏幕可用、已保存、已连接或正在等待配对码。通过四位代码配对新屏幕，并在下次活动中复用已保存的显示设备以加快设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Event Commands to map scoreboard moments to Companion page, row, and column locations. Empty assignments are ignored, so you can automate only the events that matter for the selected sport." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“事件命令”将记分牌时刻映射到 Companion 的页面、行和列位置。空分配会被忽略，因此你可以只自动化所选运动中重要的事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Format to name the custom debate, label the two sides, and decide which live-board tools are available. These choices define the behavior of the custom preset before individual segment blocks run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“格式”为自定义辩论命名、标记双方，并决定可用的实时面板工具。这些选择会在各环节模块运行前定义自定义预设的行为。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Game Setup to choose the sport, name the event, set both sides, and define the starting rules that the live control board will use. Changes here are the defaults for the next run of the current game, so set clocks, periods, tracking, and sport-specific options before operators begin." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“比赛设置”选择运动项目、命名赛事、设置双方，并定义实时控制面板将使用的开局规则。这里的更改会成为当前比赛下一次运行的默认值，因此请在操作员开始前设置计时、阶段、跟踪和项目专属选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use General to choose the debate format, label each side, and decide whether the round has score tracking. Presets fill in standard flows, while Custom Debate lets you design a format for this event." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“常规”选择辩论赛制、标记双方，并决定该轮是否跟踪分数。预设会填入标准流程，而自定义辩论可为本场活动设计赛制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use General to define the custom sport name and whether the scoreboard should track points at all. When score tracking is enabled, choose the button layout that best matches how operators usually add points." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“常规”定义自定义运动名称，以及记分牌是否跟踪分数。启用比分跟踪后，选择最符合操作员加分习惯的按钮布局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Integration to connect Scoreboard with trusted production tools on the local network. Remote Display, Web API, and Bitfocus Companion are configured independently, so enabling one integration does not turn another one off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“集成”将 Scoreboard 连接到本地网络中可信的制作工具。远程显示、Web API 和 Bitfocus Companion 独立配置，因此启用一个集成不会关闭另一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use landscape on iPhone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iPhone 上使用横屏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Library to preserve reusable game setups, recover live state, and move data between devices. Game files also appear in the Files app under Scoreboard > Library." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“资料库”保存可复用的比赛设置、恢复实时状态，并在设备之间迁移数据。比赛文件也会显示在“文件”App 的 Scoreboard > Library 下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Library to preserve reusable game setups, recover live state, and move data between devices. Game files keep operator-facing setup and scoreboard state, while full backups can include settings, game files, current game state, and logs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“资料库”保存可复用的比赛设置、恢复实时状态，并在设备之间迁移数据。比赛文件保留操作员端设置和记分牌状态，而完整备份可以包含设置、比赛文件、当前比赛状态和日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Logs to review the sequence of actions captured during a scoreboard run. Log sessions also appear in the Files app under Scoreboard > Logs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“日志”查看记分牌运行期间捕获的操作顺序。日志会话也会显示在“文件”App 的 Scoreboard > Logs 下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Logs to review the sequence of actions captured during a scoreboard run. Sessions can be inspected for audit or replay context, exported for review, or removed when they are no longer needed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“日志”查看记分牌运行期间捕获的操作顺序。会话可用于审计或回放上下文检查，也可以导出供复查，或在不再需要时移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Overflow Behavior" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用默认超出行为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Period when the custom sport has halves, innings, rounds, segments, or another phase label. The full and short labels are used by the public board, live controls, and logs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当自定义项目有半场、局、回合、环节或其他阶段标签时，使用“节”。完整标签和短标签会用于公开记分牌、实时控制和日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Period when the custom sport has halves, sets, innings, rounds, segments, or another phase label. The full and short labels are used by the public board, live controls, and logs." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“阶段”设置半场、局、局数、回合、环节或其他阶段标签。完整标签和短标签会用于公开记分牌、实时控制和日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Player settings for debate when speakers need roster entries, active lineup visibility, fouls, or cards. These options control whether the Players page and player overlay tools appear for debate rounds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当辩论选手需要名单、上场可见性、犯规或红黄牌时，使用辩论的“球员”设置。这些选项控制辩论轮次是否显示“球员”页面和球员叠层工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Player settings when the custom sport needs rosters, active lineups, player fouls, cards, or a soccer-style center player strip. Turning tracking on also enables the Players settings page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当自定义运动需要名单、上场阵容、球员犯规、红黄牌或足球式中央球员条时，使用“球员”设置。开启跟踪也会启用“球员”设置页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Players for rosters, fouls, cards, substitutions, active lineups, and player overlays during the game." : {
      "comment" : "A tip that explains what the player tracking shortcut opens.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比赛期间可使用“球员”管理名单、犯规、红黄牌、换人、上场阵容和球员叠层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Players to prepare roster details and decide which player data should appear during the game. This page controls roster size, active lineup state, fouls, cards, overlay pause behavior, and CSV roster import or export when the selected sport supports player tracking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“球员”准备名单详情，并决定比赛期间要显示哪些球员数据。所选运动支持球员跟踪时，此页面会控制名单人数、上场阵容状态、犯规、红黄牌、叠层暂停行为，以及 CSV 名单导入或导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Possession to show which side currently controls play. It is available for custom sports that use the Shot Clock timer type; Serve Timer uses serving side instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“控球”显示当前由哪一方控制比赛。它适用于使用“进攻计时器”类型的自定义项目；“发球计时器”则使用发球方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Possession to show which side currently controls play. The arrow is tied to shot-clock workflows, so it becomes available after the custom sport has shot-clock support enabled." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“球权”显示当前哪一方控球。箭头与进攻计时流程关联，因此在自定义运动启用进攻计时支持后才可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Prep" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用准备时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Prep to give each side its own preparation clock. Prep time appears beside the segment timer on the live board so operators can pause the speech flow and run side-specific prep." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“准备时间”为双方提供独立准备计时。准备时间会显示在实时面板的环节计时旁，便于操作员暂停发言流程并运行某一方的准备时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use preview to check the public scoreboard layout before sending it to a window or external display." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the preview feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用预览在发送到窗口或外部显示器前检查公开记分牌布局。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Remote Display for Apple TV, iPad, or Mac displays that should mirror the public scoreboard without browser URLs or a Web API client. Pairing happens nearby and the operator device remains the source of live updates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“远程显示”将 Apple TV、iPad 或 Mac 显示设备镜像公开记分牌，无需浏览器 URL 或 Web API 客户端。配对在附近完成，操作设备仍是实时更新来源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Remote Display Mode on iPhone when the phone should show the pairing code or drive a connected external display. For the phone screen itself, landscape still gives the scoreboard more room." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当 iPhone 需要显示配对码或驱动已连接的外接显示器时，请使用远程显示模式。若只使用手机屏幕，横屏仍能为记分牌提供更多空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Remote Display Mode when the current iPad or Mac should stop acting as an operator board and become a public remote display. On Mac you can also open a separate scoreboard window while keeping the operator controls available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前 iPad 或 Mac 需要从操作面板切换为公开远程显示时，使用远程显示模式。在 Mac 上，你也可以打开单独的记分牌窗口，同时保留操作控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Secondary Timer when the sport needs a possession-style timer beside the main game clock. Shot Clock gives operators preset reset buttons; Serve Timer gives each side a Serve Here action that resets and starts the timer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当项目需要在主比赛计时旁显示类似控球的计时器时，使用“辅助计时器”。“进攻计时器”提供预设重置按钮；“发球计时器”为双方提供“在此发球”操作，可重置并启动计时器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Segment Blocks to build the exact round flow operators will follow. Each block can have no timer, a shared master clock, or a dual side clock, and the order here becomes the live segment order." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“环节模块”构建操作员将遵循的完整轮次流程。每个模块可以无计时、使用共享主计时，或使用双方双计时；这里的顺序会成为实时环节顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Segments to confirm the speaking order, timing mode, active side, and duration before the round starts. This preview is the sequence operators will advance through on the live debate board." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“环节”在辩论开始前确认发言顺序、计时模式、当前方和时长。此预览就是操作员在实时辩论面板中推进的顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Shot Clock when the sport needs a secondary possession timer beside the main game clock. The default and preset values appear on the live board so operators can reset possession quickly." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当运动需要主比赛计时旁的第二个控球计时时，使用“进攻计时”。默认值和预设值会显示在实时控制面板上，方便操作员快速重置控球。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Sound to decide whether the app can play audio and which tones fire for each sport event. Sound settings are global to the app, while sport event assignments let different game types use different start, stop, warning, and expiration cues." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“声音”决定 App 是否播放音频，以及每个运动事件触发哪些提示音。声音设置对整个 App 生效，而运动事件分配可让不同比赛类型使用不同的开始、停止、警告和到时提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Team settings for counters and timers that belong to a side rather than an individual player. Substitutions, pauses, team fouls, and penalty timers add live controls, public display state, and log entries for both sides." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“队伍”设置管理属于一方而不是单个球员的计数器和计时器。换人、暂停、全队犯规和罚时计时器会为双方添加实时控制、公开显示状态和日志条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Team settings for counters and timers that belong to a side rather than an individual player. Substitutions, team fouls, and penalty timers add live controls, public display state, and log entries for both sides." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将“球队”设置用于属于一方而非单个球员的计数器和计时器。替补、球队犯规和罚时计时器会为双方添加实时控制、公开显示状态和日志记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Team settings for counters that belong to a side rather than an individual player. Substitutions and team fouls add live controls, reset actions, public display state, and log entries for both sides." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“队伍”设置管理属于一方而不是单个球员的计数器。换人和全队犯规会为双方添加实时控制、重置操作、公开显示状态和日志条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Templates as starting points for a custom debate format. Applying a template replaces the current custom block list with an editable copy, so choose the closest flow before fine-tuning labels and timings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“模板”作为自定义辩论赛制的起点。应用模板会用可编辑副本替换当前自定义模块列表，因此先选择最接近的流程，再微调标签和时长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the bundled Smart Scoreboard background." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用内置 Smart Scoreboard 背景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the live board for score, clock, shot clock, players, fouls, substitutions, sound, and companion controls." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用实时控制面板管理比分、计时、进攻计时、球员、犯规、换人、声音和 Companion 控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the player list to manage rosters during live operation. Quick actions handle full-game reset tasks, while each side roster lets you adjust player fouls, cards, active lineup status, and public overlay visibility without leaving the control board." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实时操作期间，使用球员列表管理名单。快速操作用于处理整场比赛的重置任务，而双方名单可让你在不离开控制面板的情况下调整球员犯规、红黄牌、上场阵容状态和公开叠层可见性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the primary screen: Settings > Integration > Remote Display." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to use the remote display.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请使用主屏幕：“设置”>“集成”>“远程显示”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the softened glow treatment on the external display." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在外部显示上使用柔化光晕效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Theme to set the visual style shared by setup, live controls, previews, and public scoreboard outputs. This page also controls display direction, public-display background treatment, and optional date or time overlays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用“主题”设置由设置页、实时控制、预览和公开记分牌输出共享的视觉样式。此页面还控制显示方向、公开显示背景处理，以及可选的日期或时间叠层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use these controls for score changes, side clocks, team fouls, substitutions, and sport-specific actions." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the score controls on the scoreboard.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
